<title>UK: Pillar Property H1 pre-tax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Pillar Property H1 pre-tax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  2.1		   vs   1.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   1.6		   vs   1.5</p>
<p> Pretax			 3.2		   vs   1.1</p>
<p> Net asset value(pence) 159.0		   vs 152.0</p>
<p>Full company name - Pillar Property Investments Plc said it was seeking more retail park acquisitions with two further purchases expected by the end of January 1997 when its portfolio is expected to consist 10 sites, valued at over 110 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +0171-542 7717</p>
</text>
